{"parse": {"title": "墓碑博物馆-06", "pageid": 119461, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A2%93%E7%A2%91%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86-05\" title=\"墓碑博物馆-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">墓碑博物馆-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A2%93%E7%A2%91%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86-07\" title=\"墓碑博物馆-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">墓碑博物馆</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AE.89.E5.AE.81\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"安宁\">安宁</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 安宁</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Peace</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">7:00 帕斯卡湾 雾</span></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory pic 09.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png/110px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png/165px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png/220px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"482\" data-file-height=\"516\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">船上，清晨</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p>彼得格勒到英吉利海峡的距离并不算近。<br />\n摇晃的船只上，有的墓碑变得沉默，有的墓碑就连身上的裂缝都在摇摆。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“史密斯先生，您似乎有些失落。这里没有您要找的那一只‘灰色怪物’吗？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>无数的船只在这里巡航。钢铁巨兽们承载着英国海军的骄傲，民众们的期待，以及无数人的心血建设而成。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“我记起来了……”汩汩冒水的石碑缓缓说道。<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:V3a1_rolestory_pic_12.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory pic 12.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/V3a1_rolestory_pic_12.png/110px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/V3a1_rolestory_pic_12.png/165px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/V3a1_rolestory_pic_12.png/220px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"482\" data-file-height=\"531\" /></a></div><br />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“那只灰色的怪兽——是这儿最宏伟的舰船。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“我负责为它上紧螺丝，涂抹漆层，检查仪表……每一天，每一夜。”一时间，原本残缺的墓碑被涌起的记忆填满，它的声音愈发激动，像是被注入了一针强心剂。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“我希望能再见它一面。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“只是见一面？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“您还需要做些别的什么吗？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“道别仪式，抑或与曾经的友人会面，我都可以协助您……我原以为它对您来说有着更不寻常的意义。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“哈哈……那是大人物们才会操办的重要仪式。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“巨大的舰船并不会因为一颗铆钉的磨损而停摆，它有着更重要的使命。”<br />\n</p>\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“我们什么都无法决定。”<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory pic 09.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png/110px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png/165px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png/220px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"482\" data-file-height=\"516\" /></a></div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>它试探性地示意着另一块残缺的墓碑所在的位置，而后者对此没有丝毫反应，穆勒已然陷入了长眠。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“……我们都只是普通人。现在变成了普通的墓碑。和路边的石头没什么两样罢了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“每一个人都是特别的。”少女认真地反驳。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“哪怕你们都成了墓碑，我也能清晰地分辨出来。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“你们身上的气息、参差的棱角，甚至裂缝的大小，都有着独特的印记。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“感谢你的开导，讣告人小姐……但这已经不重要了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“如果可以的话，我希望您能将我安置在离港口最近的灯塔上。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>史密斯：</b></span>“总有一天我会再次见到它出港，或是返航的样子……”它的语气充满期待，“<span class=\"tooltips\" style=\"cursor: help; color: #ff7a06;\">可畏号战列舰<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left; translate: 0px;\">由海军船厂制造的伟大舰艇。它庄严，庞大，是海上霸主地位的代表。</span></span>。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>它等待着，等待着记忆中的那艘舰船。<br />\n在寂静之中，它陷入了无尽的安宁。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“史密斯先生……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“我想，我知道要怎么做了。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">图书馆，清晨</span></div>\n</div><div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory pic 10.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png/110px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"119\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png/165px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png/220px-V3a1_rolestory_pic_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"482\" data-file-height=\"520\" /></a></div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>这是她第一次违背对于逝者的承诺。<br />\n在她身后，书报店的店主狐疑地观察着她。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>店主：</b></span>“所有提及过可畏号的报纸都被你翻了个遍……小姐，你到底打算寻找什么？”店主质问道。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>店主：</b></span>“你该不会是敌国间谍吧？！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“不必了，先生。我已经找到了。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><small style=\"color: #999;\">翻开报纸</small><br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“可畏号被鱼雷击中右舷，最终不幸沉没。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“海上情况恶劣，无法展开救援工作。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“共35名军官和512名船员在沉没中丧生。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“已成水下墓园……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>讣告人：</b></span>“严厉谴责德军行为，我方将对此复仇。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>在船员的名单中，她看到了史密斯的名字。<br />\n讣告人小心翼翼地把史密斯的墓石包在了一张陈旧的报纸里，她并没有如史密斯所愿地把它放在任何一座灯塔之上。<br />\n</p>\n</div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "墓碑博物馆-06"}}